# 统一换行：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时按平台/类型转换。
# 注释本身用中文，文件保持 UTF-8（无 BOM）。
* text=auto

# Windows 脚本必须 CRLF，Windows PowerShell 5.1 / cmd.exe 才稳定
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 解决方案 / 项目文件：文本，但保留原有换行风格
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.csproj text
*.props text
*.targets text

# 二进制资产：不要做换行/文本转换，也不要显示 diff
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.pdf binary

# Release 页面/更新日志由 GitHub 渲染，标记为文本
*.md text
